# Data directories: legacy benchmark/research artifacts from VIXEN's research-platform days.
# No longer relevant to the game-renderer path; kept local-only (regeneratable by the
# benchmark). Previously `!data/finalized/` / `!data/templates/` force-tracked these — dropped
# so the ~385MB research dump stays out of the engine repo.
data/
data/*

# Exception: Keep RenderGraph Data/ folder (contains node configs)
!libraries/*/include/Data/
!libraries/*/include/Data/**

